1. Objective
The objective of the system architecture is to define the components, responsibilities, communication flow, and data flow of the Intelligent Bug Diagnosis Platform.
The architecture is designed to support bug submission, bug processing, historical defect retrieval, semantic similarity analysis, RAG-based knowledge retrieval, AI-agent-based diagnosis, and fix recommendation.
